# Optional. Without a key everything runs deterministically (tesseract OCR for scanned pages,
# template-based summary). With a key: vision second-read of scanned pages, extraction of
# unknown supplier layouts, and an LLM-worded CFO summary (numbers verified against facts).
GROQ_API_KEY=
# Models default to config/llm.json; set these only to override it for one environment.
# GROQ_TEXT_MODEL=openai/gpt-oss-120b
# GROQ_VISION_MODEL=meta-models/muse-spark-open
# Called only when the model above is rate-limited (429, or 413 over tokens-per-minute); empty = no fallback.
# GROQ_FALLBACK_TEXT_MODEL=openai/gpt-oss-20b
# GROQ_FALLBACK_VISION_MODEL=qwen/qwen3.8-27b
